{"3966780": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mr. Smiley's Quiz Of Terror", "steam_appid": 3966780, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to a high-stakes quiz where your life is on the line. Answer correctly and you will keep Mr. Smiley at bay and live. Answer incorrectly and he may eat you whole. Your knowledge will be tested across several categories, and you will get a choice as to which topic you want to go with. Examples include Anime, Maths, Gaming, History and General Knowledge. Which one will you stake your life on?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rounds consist of several types of questions, including &quot;Spot the odd one out&quot; and &quot;True or False&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the game progresses, Mr. Smiley will get faster, but you'll gain access to cards that will aid you in your task.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a true test of knowledge. Good luck!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to a high-stakes quiz where your life is on the line. Answer correctly and you will keep Mr. Smiley at bay and live. Answer incorrectly and he may eat you whole. Your knowledge will be tested across several categories, and you will get a choice as to which topic you want to go with. Examples include Anime, Maths, Gaming, History and General Knowledge. Which one will you stake your life on?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rounds consist of several types of questions, including &quot;Spot the odd one out&quot; and &quot;True or False&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the game progresses, Mr. Smiley will get faster, but you'll gain access to cards that will aid you in your task.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a true test of knowledge. Good luck!</p>", "short_description": "Your life depends on your knowledge. Answer questions correctly to keep Mr. Smiley at bay. Each round will give you a choice of 3 topics, such as Gaming, History, or Gen